---
// Minimal static error page: no site data, no API calls. Astro renders it with
// status 500 when an SSR data request fails, so the failure is visible to
// monitoring instead of being masked by a half-rendered 200.
Astro.response.status = 500;
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <title>500 · 服务暂时不可用</title>
    <style>
      :root {
        color-scheme: light dark;
        --accent: #c2451f;
      }
      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: grid;
        place-content: center;
        gap: 14px;
        padding: 32px;
        background: #f7f6f2;
        color: #12120f;
        font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
      }
      strong {
        font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 8vw, 4rem);
        line-height: 1;
        letter-spacing: -0.04em;
        color: var(--accent);
      }
      h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        font-weight: 600;
      }
      p {
        margin: 0;
        max-width: 46ch;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        line-height: 1.7;
        color: #5c5a53;
      }
      a {
        color: var(--accent);
        font-size: 0.85rem;
      }
      @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
        body {
          background: #0c0c0b;
          color: #f2f0e9;
        }
        p {
          color: #a8a59b;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <strong>500</strong>
    <h1>服务暂时不可用</h1>
    <p>页面需要的内容服务没有正常响应。请稍后刷新，或确认后端已经启动。</p>
    <a href="/">← 返回首页</a>
  </body>
</html>
